From fb932bb850ae3c6a03356d3f1da36051018267a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 23:28:39 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fixup! chronik(v2): isolate MDBX access and persist branch,
 asset and explorer indexes

Document public index records, serde adapters and query joins; derive Debug for the immutable asset view; name owned MDBX key/value pairs; remove a duplicate existing unsafe allow while retaining the module-level FFI boundary. Replace two Option APIs newer than declared MSRV1.80 with equivalent map_or predicates. No new allows, field serialization or index semantics changes. Clears94 previously masked strict Clippy diagnostics with the separately owned T1 arithmetic/MSRV repair; aggregate Chronik Clippy and134tests pass.

Tier: V2 (fixup to chronik(v2): isolate MDBX access and persist branch, asset and explorer indexes)
